The merge never guesses a list's id field. A call to `expandTemplatesSync` with a list of blocks must pass its `idField`, `@id` included, or it throws; inside a call, other lists are read by their blocks, never by ids. A template's own page now keeps a form's fields as they are, instead of re-applying the template to them. `insertSnippetBlocks` and `cloneBlocksWithNewIds` take an `idFieldMap` for the lists they copy.
